NodeForge ships an MCP server with **21 tools**, **6 prompts**, and **22 resource types**.

**Quick setup:**
1. Build: `cd packages/agent && pnpm build`
2. Add to `.cursor/mcp.json`:
```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "nodeforge": {
      "command": "node",
      "args": ["/path/to/nodeforge/packages/agent/dist/cli.js"],
      "env": { "NODEFORGE_WORKSPACE_ROOT": "/your/project" }
    }
  }
}
```
3. Restart Cursor

Then ask: "What does this project use?", "Run diagnostics", "Validate the workspace".
